<title>CHINA: LOGIC INT'L SELLS HK$175 MLN OFFICE.</title>
<headline>LOGIC INT'L SELLS HK$175 MLN OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logic International Ltd said on Tuesday it would sell an office floor in Queensway in Hong Kong to a third party Glory Cathay Investment Ltd for HK$175 million.</p>
<p>The office furniture distributor said the disposal represents its move to realise non-operating assets. It said net proceeds would be used to reduce borrowings.</p>
<p>Trading in the shares, suspended on Monday, resumed on Tuesday. The share edged down HK$0.05 to HK$2.30 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
